  "notes": "AFN Sasebo indoor, front-oblique, right-handed woman (white shirt, glasses, yellow wristband) at the kitchen line. Cross-body contact on her LEFT side with follow-through high-right = BACKHAND volley (ball taken out of the air at chest height). Her PARTNER (black shirt, pink paddle) reaches from behind - a wrong-paddle trap. She also holds a SPARE BALL in her left hand throughout (ball-color confuser). Labels eyeballed from raw stills (~±0.02). Phases: prep/accel/follow estimated ±2 frames; recoveryEnd uncertain. Rev2: event labels (target volley E + partner swing E), partner pink-paddle labels (visible 2830, occluded 2900/2960). Rev6 (wave-a, devin-visual-v2-wave-a): +4 target dink-battle events (contacts 317/1117/1484/1717, all ball-at-paddle verified at 29.97fps) +1 partner dig (1934, ball-reversal) in the previously-unlabeled 0-2100ms of this clip; existing labels untouched. The 2118-2600 stretch (one more possible dig before the labeled volley's prep) is deliberately left unlabeled to avoid semantic collision with the existing 2600-3600 event.",
